  ('91851568-3a56-572a-b50a-b37dddf32709', 'the-arbor-house', 'The Arbor House', 'A courtyard house arranged around three old neem trees', 'The Arbor House was designed around what was already on the site: three mature neem trees, now held within a central courtyard that brings shade, birdsong and a changing pattern of light into every room.
