  ('00a6fc37-d665-5c58-858e-6f24b1e945b6', 'the-sabarmati-penthouse', 'The Sabarmati Penthouse', 'A double-height residence above the river', 'Occupying the top two floors of a slender riverfront building, this penthouse is organized around a double-height living room that frames the Sabarmati and the old city beyond. At dusk the view turns gold, then blue, then to a long line of lights along the promenade.

