  ('aa83fdfe-06ca-54b4-b555-fe24d27d38ce', 'kesar-villa', 'Kesar Villa', 'A family villa behind a perforated screen', 'Kesar Villa presents a calm, almost blank face to the street: a white perforated screen that softens the western sun and becomes, at night, a lantern. Behind it, the house opens to a long garden and a pool lined in green stone.

