  ('f55d2524-3fe2-546e-a2d1-6a15ccc5b477', 'the-granite-house', 'The Granite House', 'A weekend house among the boulders below Nandi Hills', 'An hour north of the city, The Granite House sits among the boulders and scrub forest below Nandi Hills. Its dark timber and concrete volumes are set low into the landscape, with tall windows that glow like lanterns in the evening.

