  ('676e1251-d1d4-5e83-befc-559ce9a4c461', 'the-indiranagar-residence', 'The Indiranagar Residence', 'A garden apartment on one of the city''s leafiest avenues', 'A ground-floor apartment in a boutique building of only six homes, The Indiranagar Residence has something rare in the city center: a private garden, shaded by a rain tree older than the street around it.

