  ('c53a0013-76bf-5113-9045-40fdf8069e0e', 'casa-verde', 'Casa Verde', 'A contemporary tropical residence designed around light, landscape and privacy', 'Casa Verde is a contemporary tropical residence designed around light, landscape and privacy. Set within an acre of mature planting in Assagao, its rooms are arranged as a series of pavilions connected by shaded walkways, each opening onto its own garden.

A green-stone pool runs the length of the main lawn, mirroring a canopy of frangipani and areca palms. Deep tiled roofs and laterite walls keep the house cool through the summer; during the monsoon, broad verandahs make the rain part of daily life. Four bedroom suites, a studio and a guest cottage give room for family and friends without ever feeling crowded.', 'goa', 'Assagao', 'Assagao, Bardez, North Goa', 15.5958, 73.7656, 65000000, 'villa'::public.property_type, 4, 5, 5200, 2021, 3, 'available'::public.property_status, true, '[{"category":"schools","name":"International school (IB curriculum)","distanceKm":2.4},{"category":"schools","name":"Senior secondary school","distanceKm":2.3},{"category":"schools","name":"Montessori pre-school","distanceKm":0.7},{"category":"healthcare","name":"Multi-speciality hospital","distanceKm":2.5},{"category":"healthcare","name":"24-hour pharmacy and clinic","distanceKm":0.9},{"category":"dining","name":"Neighborhood café","distanceKm":0.3},{"category":"dining","name":"Chef-led restaurant","distanceKm":1.8},{"category":"dining","name":"Bakery and deli","distanceKm":1.4},{"category":"shopping","name":"Gourmet grocer","distanceKm":0.5},{"category":"shopping","name":"Retail and design district","distanceKm":4.4},{"category":"transit","name":"Railway station","distanceKm":2.3},{"category":"transit","name":"International airport (Mopa)","distanceKm":19.3}]'::jsonb, '5922d2a7-20c5-5ded-a418-cdaff035469b', '2026-08-27T10:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-27T10:00:00.000Z'),
  ('5e567f6e-fe0e-5ede-8ef0-6efead51d430', 'siolim-riverhouse', 'Siolim Riverhouse', 'A house on the Chapora, with a deck over the water', 'Siolim Riverhouse sits on a bend of the Chapora river, where fishing boats pass in the early morning and the light settles gold in the evening. A timber deck extends over the water from the edge of an infinity pool, with a private jetty below.

The house itself is a refined interpretation of the Goan villa: thick walls, high ceilings, shuttered windows and verandahs on every side. Five bedrooms, a garden room and an outdoor dining pavilion make it equally suited to a large family or a long season of guests.', 'goa', 'Siolim', 'Siolim, Bardez, North Goa', 15.6272, 73.7608, 89000000, 'waterfront'::public.property_type, 5, 6, 6400, 2018, 3, 'available'::public.property_status, true, '[{"category":"schools","name":"International school (IB curriculum)","distanceKm":3.8},{"category":"schools","name":"Senior secondary school","distanceKm":2.6},{"category":"schools","name":"Montessori pre-school","distanceKm":0.7},{"category":"healthcare","name":"Multi-speciality hospital","distanceKm":5.3},{"category":"healthcare","name":"24-hour pharmacy and clinic","distanceKm":0.9},{"category":"dining","name":"Neighborhood café","distanceKm":0.9},{"category":"dining","name":"Chef-led restaurant","distanceKm":1.1},{"category":"dining","name":"Bakery and deli","distanceKm":1.4},{"category":"shopping","name":"Gourmet grocer","distanceKm":1.6},{"category":"shopping","name":"Retail and design district","distanceKm":1.4},{"category":"transit","name":"Railway station","distanceKm":1.3},{"category":"transit","name":"International airport (Mopa)","distanceKm":16.8}]'::jsonb, '5922d2a7-20c5-5ded-a418-cdaff035469b', '2026-09-14T10:00:00.000Z', '2026-09-14T10:00:00.000Z'),
  ('e1682096-39c5-5a1e-9213-6d6962d1ce46', 'saltwater-residence', 'Saltwater Residence', 'A two-bedroom apartment a short walk from Candolim beach', 'A two-bedroom apartment in a low-rise building of white walls and palm gardens, a short walk from Candolim beach. A wide balcony runs the length of the living room, with views over the shared pool to the coconut groves.

