  ('0a964fa2-14fa-57cc-b7a1-8291c9c8c124', 'ridge-house-lonavala', 'Ridge House', 'Stone, glass and the valley below', 'Ridge House is set on a hillside above Lonavala, where the monsoon brings waterfalls to the valley and mist through the trees. Its dark-clad upper floor is lifted on a glazed base, so the living spaces feel suspended over the view.

