  ('d917a4d0-0a76-5813-917b-3df520c40d91', 'koregaon-park-penthouse', 'Koregaon Park Penthouse', 'A penthouse among the rain trees', 'Above the canopy of Koregaon Park''s rain trees, this penthouse pairs a crisp white interior with a courtyard terrace and a plunge pool lit for evenings. Steel-framed glass doors slide away entirely, joining the living room and terrace into a single space.

