  ('30590fd8-daab-572b-8c58-e195321dd4ac', 'the-aravalli-estate', 'The Aravalli Estate', 'A farmhouse villa on two and a half acres of garden', 'The Aravalli Estate occupies two and a half acres of mature garden in Chhatarpur — lawns, a fruit orchard and a grove of old neem and jamun trees. At its center, a white, symmetrical villa looks over a pool set on the main axis of the garden.

